mstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2258840/extras/a69997d7e082a230585a3637b7aa1b90.avif?t=1687552100\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Scavenge resources, discover schematics, and craft a variety of items.<br></li><li>Slower and more methodical combat requires a specific strategy for each encounter.<br></li><li>Exploit certain &quot;reaction&quot; states with various abilities for additional damage and effects.<br></li><li>New overkill system with a fatality-style finisher that's unique to each enemy.<br></li><li>No random encounters. All enemies are scripted into each map.<br></li><li>Find an ARENA-bot companion and upgrade them for additional abilities.<br></li><li>Fully voiced dialogue by a talented cast of actors.<br></li><li>Plenty of exploring, hidden rooms, puzzles, and combinations to decipher.<br></li><li>Dark and atmospheric with a horror/sci-fi theme.<br></li><li> THERE'S A CAT!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2258840/extras/16af7a6a71cbd21fd2da3055f7f65271.poster.avif?t=1687552100\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2258840/extras/16af7a6a71cbd21fd2da3055f7f65271.webm?t=1687552100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2258840/extras/16af7a6a71cbd21fd2da3055f7f65271.mp4?t=1687552100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2258840/extras/fc04b597d0bf3ad04cc2253fad37e0f3.poster.avif?t=1687552100\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2258840/extras/fc04b597d0bf3ad04cc2253fad37e0f3.webm?t=1687552100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2258840/extras/fc04b597d0bf3ad04cc2253fad37e0f3.mp4?t=1687552100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2258840/extras/87945d47a396c54bbb4ca46524683dc8.avif?t=1687552100\" /></span></li></ul>",
